  "question": "What's the closest nature reserve towards the southeast of Blasingame Soccer Complex, Alma, AR?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-94.213871 35.478418)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'nature_reserve'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 112.5 AND 157.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
